10. INTRO COMPLETION STATE
==================================================

Use the existing:

SaveState.introPartBDone

as the SINGLE persistent source of truth for whether the COMPLETE intro has already been completed.

From now on, interpret:

introPartBDone

as:

"Has the player completed Intro Part A + Intro Part B?"


Rules:

NO saved game:
→ Intro A runs
→ Intro B runs


Saved game with:

introPartBDone === false

→ complete intro runs from Intro A
→ then Intro B


Saved game with:

introPartBDone === true

→ skip BOTH Intro A and Intro B
→ enter normal gameplay


Do NOT introduce:

- introPartADone
- another localStorage intro key
- sessionStorage intro completion
- cookies
- IndexedDB intro flags
- separate browser intro flags

SaveState.introPartBDone must remain the single persistent intro-completion value.


